From 29c659023e515f7b6dfcd95946293d9f567ec901 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:53:53 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed playlist, browse and play queue menu icons

Gives the remaining library and play queue menus the redesign's two-tone orange icons and wording: the library playlist menu becomes Play, Shuffle (new, plays the playlist with shuffle on) and Add to Queue as in the design, playlist items and Browse items use Play, Add to Queue, Add to Playlist and Information with icons, adding a folder to the library gets the add-folder icon, and the play queue menu entries use the new play, stream, info, folder, add, add-folder, export and shuffle icons.
---
